        "Tokens ≈ ceil(JSON bytes / 4)",
        "--memory: per-workspace store outside the repo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Safety defaults",
      "items": [
        "Only allowlisted read-only verbs reach ripwire",
        "context_after_edit paths must resolve inside the root",
        "Repository text under untrusted_repository_data",
        "Jev key only from RIPWIRE_BROKER_JEV_API_KEY"
      ]
